<p class='lede'>A deliberately vulnerable web service for measuring how well a security scanner finds cross-site scripting. Every endpoint carries its own vulnerability class, taint source, and sink.</p>
<p class='params'>Payloads arrive through <code>query</code><code>callback</code><code>query2</code><code>seed</code><code>blob</code><code>url</code> plus path segments and request headers.</p>
</header>
